WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:16.056
Vroom! Vroom!

2
00:00:16.057 --> 00:00:22.584
Eddy zoomed around.

3
00:00:22.585 --> 00:00:26.136
"Way to go, Eddy!" said Jeb.

4
00:00:26.137 --> 00:00:29.505
"You're fast!" said Dipper.

5
00:00:29.506 --> 00:00:33.654
Honk! Honk! Poppy tooted her horn.

6
00:00:33.655 --> 00:00:37.876
Eddy grinned.

7
00:00:37.877 --> 00:00:48.503
"Someday I'll be a race car!" he said.

8
00:00:48.504 --> 00:00:51.886
"No, you won't," said Zippy.

9
00:00:51.887 --> 00:00:58.588
"You're too slow!"

10
00:00:58.589 --> 00:01:04.254
Eddy frowned.

11
00:01:04.255 --> 00:01:12.676
Ms. Fender came outside.

12
00:01:12.677 --> 00:01:15.796
"Good morning!" said the teacher.

13
00:01:15.797 --> 00:01:19.897
"It's time for safety class."

14
00:01:19.898 --> 00:01:23.697
"Safety class?" said Zippy.

15
00:01:23.698 --> 00:01:27.436
"That's boring!"

16
00:01:27.437 --> 00:01:32.939
"Safety is important," said Ms. Fender.

17
00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:38.669
She led everyone to a track.

18
00:01:38.670 --> 00:01:42.887
Eddy saw cones.

19
00:01:42.888 --> 00:01:45.805
He saw stop signs.

20
00:01:45.806 --> 00:01:48.841
He saw traffic lights.

21
00:01:48.842 --> 00:01:53.005
"We'll practice here," said Ms. Fender.

22
00:01:53.006 --> 00:01:56.673
"Everyone will drive on the track.

23
00:01:56.674 --> 00:01:59.172
Don't go too fast."

24
00:01:59.173 --> 00:02:02.378
Zippy laughed.

25
00:02:02.379 --> 00:02:06.273
"This will be easy for Eddy.

26
00:02:06.274 --> 00:02:14.707
He's slow!"
